        <li>When we chat with you (e.g. WhatsApp, Facebook, regular SMS, etc.) the chat might be accidentally closed/removed, there might be interruptions, slow internet connection, etc. We may contact you later via automated phone and text messages or email (if available) in order to restore our communication started within the chat. No purchase necessary. You can opt out from further communication by replying to SMS/email or notifying us during the phone call.</li>
